<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106815" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαίθρ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Andr.</u>
			227
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθήρ</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under the sky, in the open air,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				6.61
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. κατακοιμηθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.134
			</span></i>; of troops, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.5.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.6.24
			</span></i>: also of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύχνα καίειν ὑπαίθρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.62
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὑ. πάγων δρόσων τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					335
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαιθριοις δεσμοῖς πεπασσαλευμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					113
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. δρόσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. δεξαμεναί,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόστεγοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				117b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστι . . ὑ. τὸ στιππύον ἐρριμμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.404.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἔργα</span>
			<i>outdoor</i> work, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				7.20
			</span></i>:—<i>in the open, in public,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαίθριος πεῖραν αὑτοῦ διδούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Apol.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὑπαιθρίῳ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὑπαίθρῳ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.94
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Epim.</u>
				140
			</span></i>.</div>
